vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669620/extras/c0e2dbf6204e098720a8fcd8b0ecab01.mp4?t=1772633800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is not the end for these champions of endless war. A growing roster of unlockable characters, weapons, abilities and rare relics will increase your odds of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669620/extras/177301ba44ea0d22be500d6eccbc894b.webp?t=1772633800\" width=780 height=24 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669620/extras/ac4d716e1fae37ee1c7d88d2c42b93b0.webp?t=1772633800\" alt=\"Features\" width=780 height=44 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast and frantic Survivors gameplay.\u00a0\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A roster of iconic characters from the Warhammer 40,000 and Warhammer: Age of Sigmar universes, featuring Warhammer 40,000: Boltgun\u2019s very own Malum Caedo!\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple modes and stages from across the grim, dark 41st Millennium and the Mortal Realms.\u00a0\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An arsenal of familiar weapons, such as the Boltgun, Astartes Chainsword, Whirlwind Axes and easter eggs such as the humble pot of Nuln Oil.\u00a0\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mighty cache of passives and power-ups to aid in enduring against the monstrous legions.\u00a0\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Esoteric secrets to uncover and collectables to collect!\u00a0\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>...and more to be announced!</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669620/extras/6370f681c0a2ecf37ac74301303d7951.webp?t=1772633800\" width=780 height=44 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Load your Bolter and check back regularly as we reveal more coming to Warhammer Survivors!</i>\u00a0</p>","developers":["Auroch Digital"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669620/dc61fccdeec6b05a58fbcdd7b1d0bbbe1f6999ea/header.jpg?t=1772633800","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Warhammer Survivors \u00a9 Copyright Games Workshop Limited 2026. Warhammer Age of Sigmar, the Warhammer Age of Sigmar logo, Warhammer Survivors logo, GW, Games Workshop, Warhammer, Warhammer Age of Sigmar, Stormcast Eternals, Space Marine, 40K, Warhammer, Warhammer 40,000, the \u2018Aquila\u2019 Double-headed Eagle logo, and all\u00a0associated logos, illustrations, images, names, creatures, races, vehicles, locations, weapons, characters, and the distinctive likeness thereof, are either \u00ae or TM, and/or \u00a9 Games Workshop Limited, variably registered around the world, and used under licence. Auroch Digital and its logos are trademarks or registered trademarks of Auroch Digital. Poncle and the Poncle logo are trademarks of Poncle Ltd. All rights reserved to their respective owners.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</st